 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h2>Standard Types (Std_Types)</h2><p class=\"lead\">Standard types, return codes (Std_ReturnType, E_OK, E_NOT_OK), version info structures, and error codes shared across the entire AUTOSAR architecture.</p>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3>Typen — Übersicht</h3>\n<ul class=\"mlist\">\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">enum <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">This type can be used as standard API return type which is shared between the RTE and the BSW modules.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">struct <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_Std_00015\">Std_VersionInfoType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">This type shall be used to request the version of a BSW module using the _ Get Version Info() function.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">typedef <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_Std_00021\">Std_TransformerError</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">-</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">typedef <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_Std_00024\">Std_TransformerClass</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">-</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">typedef <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_Std_00027\">Std_TransformerForward</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">- Tags: atp.Status=draft</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">typedef <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_Std_00029\">Std_TransformerForwardCode</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">- Tags: atp.Status=draft</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_Std_91001\">Std_MessageType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">This type is used to encode the different type of messages.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">enum <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_Std_91002\">Std_MessageResultType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">This type is used to encode different types of results for response messages.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">typedef <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_Std_91003\">Std_ExtractProtocolHeaderFieldsType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">Type for the function pointer to extract the relevant protocol header fields of the message and the type of the message result...</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_Std_00006\">E_OK / E_NOT_OK</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">Because E_ OK is already defined within OSEK, the symbol E_ OK has to be shared.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_Std_00007\">STD_HIGH / STD_LOW</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">The symbols STD_ HIGH and STD_ LOW shall be defined as follows: #define STD_ HIGH 0x01u /* Physical state 5V or 3.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_Std_00013\">STD_ACTIVE / STD_IDLE</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">The symbols STD_ ACTIVE and STD_ IDLE shall be defined as follows: #define STD_ ACTIVE 0x01u /* Logical state active */...</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_Std_00010\">STD_ON / STD_OFF</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">The symbols STD_ ON and STD_ OFF shall be defined as follows: #define STD_ ON 0x01u #define STD_ OFF 0x00u</span></li>\n</ul>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h2 class=\"sect\">Typen — Detailansicht</h2>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Std_00005\"><span class=\"kind\">type</span> Std_ReturnType <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_Std_00005\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_Std_00005]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_StandardTypes.pdf#nameddest=SWS_Std_00005\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_StandardTypes.pdf (Anker: #SWS_Std_00005, S. 16)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">typedef <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00013\">uint8</a> <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a>;</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>This type can be used as standard API return type which is shared between the RTE and the BSW modules. It shall be defined as follows: typedef uint8 Std_ Return Type;</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Std_00015\"><span class=\"kind\">type</span> Std_VersionInfoType <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_Std_00015\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_Std_00015]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_StandardTypes.pdf#nameddest=SWS_Std_00015\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_StandardTypes.pdf (Anker: #SWS_Std_00015, S. 17)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">typedef struct { <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00014\">uint16</a> vendorID; <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00014\">uint16</a> moduleID; <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00013\">uint8</a> sw_major_version; <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00013\">uint8</a> sw_minor_version; <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00013\">uint8</a> sw_patch_version; } <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"#SWS_Std_00015\">Std_VersionInfoType</a>;</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>This type shall be used to request the version of a BSW module using the <Module name>_ Get Version Info() function.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Std_00021\"><span class=\"kind\">type</span> Std_TransformerError <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_Std_00021\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_Std_00021]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_StandardTypes.pdf#nameddest=SWS_Std_00021\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_StandardTypes.pdf (Anker: #SWS_Std_00021)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
